=== prompt
FizzBuzz for 1 to 15: for each number log `FizzBuzz` if it is divisible by 15, `Fizz` if divisible by 3, `Buzz` if divisible by 5, and the number itself otherwise. One line per number.
=== expected
1
2
Fizz
4
Buzz
Fizz
7
8
Fizz
Buzz
11
Fizz
13
14
FizzBuzz
=== reference
0 | Var(n)
Repeat({
  Inc(n)
  n | Math.Divide(3) | Math.Multiply(3) | Is(n) = by3
  n | Math.Divide(5) | Math.Multiply(5) | Is(n) = by5
  If({All(by3 by5)} {"FizzBuzz" | Log} {
    If({by3} {"Fizz" | Log} {
      If({by5} {"Buzz" | Log} {n | Log})
    })
  })
} times: 15)
